00:28:49,300 --> 00:28:51,558
Then what should I be looking at?

282
00:28:57,716 --> 00:28:59,841
I've taken care of your brother's matters.

283
00:28:59,841 --> 00:29:01,350
Don't worry.

284
00:29:08,050 --> 00:29:09,675
Big Bro.

285
00:29:09,675 --> 00:29:12,350
Someone will be here soon.

286
00:29:13,714 --> 00:29:15,181
Scared?

287
00:29:16,383 --> 00:29:18,141
Why are you hiding?

288
00:29:19,050 --> 00:29:21,675
Didn't you cry in my arms yesterday?

289
00:29:21,675 --> 00:29:25,308
I'm just afraid someone might see us.

290
00:29:29,425 --> 00:29:31,225
That's not what I meant.

291
00:30:19,341 --> 00:30:21,257
What's this?

292
00:30:21,257 --> 00:30:23,134
The key to my apartment.

293
00:30:25,341 --> 00:30:27,382
Big Bro, it's fine.

294
00:30:27,382 --> 00:30:30,141
It's quite convenient staying at school.

295
00:30:32,633 --> 00:30:36,341
Starting tomorrow,
I'm moving into my apartment.

296
00:30:36,341 --> 00:30:38,433
And you're coming with me.

297
00:30:41,591 --> 00:30:43,800
Did you put off moving out

298
00:30:43,800 --> 00:30:46,725
because of my daily soup runs?

299
00:31:14,050 --> 00:31:17,008
<i>Lu Xiao Fan did not know
what all that had passed</i>

300
00:31:17,008 --> 00:31:22,049
<i>between him and Bei Lv Qing
these days truly meant,</i>

301
00:31:22,049 --> 00:31:24,508
<i>nor what it had changed.</i>

302
00:31:24,508 --> 00:31:26,508
<i>But somehow,</i>

303
00:31:26,508 --> 00:31:29,133
<i>being permitted to attend
to Bei Lv Qing's daily needs</i>

304
00:31:29,133 --> 00:31:34,766
<i>filled Xiao Fan with a sense of honor.</i>

305
00:31:42,300 --> 00:31:44,341
Two. Three. Four.

306
00:31:44,341 --> 00:31:47,850
Two clay pots.

307
00:31:56,008 --> 00:31:58,183
Soy sauce.

308
00:32:36,925 --> 00:32:37,925
Big Bro.

309
00:32:37,925 --> 00:32:39,466
You're back.

310
00:32:39,466 --> 00:32:40,841
What soup are we having tonight?

311
00:32:40,841 --> 00:32:43,300
Oh, I made winter melon and spare rib soup.

312
00:32:43,300 --> 00:32:46,258
Big Bro, I got a really good cut of ribs today.

313
00:32:46,258 --> 00:32:47,891
Good.

314
00:32:48,883 --> 00:32:50,633
I also picked up some household stuff.

315
00:32:50,633 --> 00:32:52,508
I don't know what brand you use.

316
00:32:52,508 --> 00:32:54,308
So, I just grabbed whatever.
[Call Me B.Duck]

317
00:32:59,300 --> 00:33:01,883
That one? I bought it on sale.

318
00:33:01,883 --> 00:33:04,058
I didn't look closely at the brand.

319
00:33:07,841 --> 00:33:09,891
You sure...

320
00:33:10,633 --> 00:33:12,966
you want me to use this?

321
00:33:12,966 --> 00:33:14,341
You don't have to.

322
00:33:14,341 --> 00:33:16,516
I'll just keep it for myself.

323
00:33:23,383 --> 00:33:24,975
Let's bathe together.

324
00:33:25,675 --> 00:33:26,883
The soup's burning.

325
00:33:26,883 --> 00:33:28,516
The soup's going to burn.

326
00:33:34,508 --> 00:33:35,841
Here.

327
00:33:35,841 --> 00:33:37,133
Big Bro.

328
00:33:37,133 --> 00:33:38,725
Try it, quick.

329
00:33:43,550 --> 00:33:44,975
Have a taste.

330
00:33:53,827 --> 00:33:55,211
Well?

331
00:33:56,758 --> 00:33:58,058
Not bad.

